/*!
\page qtlabs-modules.html
\title Qt.labs experimental modules
\brief Lists the modules in the Qt.labs namespace.

Qt provides a set of experimental modules in the \c {Qt.labs} namespace.
These modules are intended for testing new features and APIs before they are
stabilized and moved to the main Qt namespace.

\c {Qt.labs} modules are experimental and may be removed in future releases. They
are not subject to any compatibility guarantee, and their API may change without
deprecation. Use them at your own risk.

\list
\li \l {Qt Labs FolderListModel QML Types}{Qt.labs.folderlistmodel} -
    Provides a model of the contents of a file system folder.
\li \l {Qt Labs Synchronizer QML Types}{Qt.labs.synchronizer} -
    Synchronizes values between two or more properties.
\li \l {Qt Qml Models experimental QML Types}{Qt.labs.qmlmodels} -
    Provides experimental QML types related to data models.
\li \e Deprecated \l {Qt Labs Settings QML Types}{Qt.labs.settings} -
    Provides a way to store and retrieve application settings.
\endlist

*/
